title: Invoice
+++
% // A page a message is addressed to. Its name is its path without the
% // extension, "/" written as ".", so this is `handlers.invoice` — no
% // front matter declares it and nothing registers it.
% //
% // Delivered, it renders with the message as `req`, exactly as it would
% // under $.render(name, data). Whether the caller waited for the answer
% // is not this page's business: rendered inline it returns a tree,
% // delivered from a queue it runs for its effects.
= Invoice for {{ req.customer }}

Order {{ req.id }} — ${{ req.total }} due.
